+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+Each location has a `site` referencing an entry in `sites`. Batches, stock-takes
+and temperature readings belong to the site of their location; ledger movements
+belong to the site of their batch. Migration assigns existing locations to the
+`main` site without changing the records that reference them.
